      "script": "scripts/check-measured-figures.mjs",
      "when": "every CI run",
      "what": "npmLatest and versionCount are re-read from the registry and a disagreement FAILS the build. So this file cannot go stale silently, which is what distinguishes it from results/signed-record-coverage.json, whose corpus half nothing re-confirms.",
